{"server":"jp","storyId":"act12d0_level_act12d0_08_end","groupId":"act12d0","stageId":"act12d0_08","title":"ガヴィルの拳","storyCode":"RI-8","avgTag":"戦闘後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_08_end.txt","sourceHash":"e7a57fb99111afb0d92dfdac35ebaba1ecd2a947e2eeced47e7a8d04f5ff3817","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_village_2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"のわああああああ！　うーむ、いまいちじゃな。次は別の叫び声にしようかのう、少々飽きてしまった……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"おい、あいつは大丈夫なのかよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"心配ない、じきに戻る。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"じゃあいいけどよ。つーかあれって本当に普通のヤツなのか？　あんなヤツがいるなんて聞いたことねぇんだけど。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"私にもわからない。本人からは、ずいぶん長くここで生活していたという話しか聞いていない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"ふぅん。それよりも……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"本当に大したデカブツだったな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ブレイズ","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"ガヴィル、頭から血が出てるよ！　大丈夫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"平気平気、こんくらい掠り傷だよ。トミミ、アタシの救急箱を持ってきてくれ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"ん？　トミミのガキンチョはどこ行ったんだ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウタゲ","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"ほい、救急箱だよ。トミミなら、あいつを倒す寸前に慌ててどっかに走ってったけど……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"サンキュー。まさかあいつ、ちびったんじゃねぇだろうな。まあいいや、先に手当しとくか。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"そうだ、お前らはほかにケガ人がいないか見てきてくれねぇか。いたら全員ここに連れてきてくれ。アタシが診るから。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ケオベ","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"おー、おいらにまかせろ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ブレイズ","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"ハハッ、了解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウタゲ","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"えー、めんど。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"クロワッサン","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"ほらほら、文句はその辺にしときや。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"ドクター……ん？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"ビッグ……アグリー……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"ズゥママ、わりぃな。バラバラにブッ壊すしかなかった。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"わかっている。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"確認した限り、お前のエンジンは無事のようだ。あとで返そう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"そうか、そりゃあ助かるぜ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"ガヴィル、ここに残るつもりはないのか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"お前と同じように、アタシにもやりたいことが見つかったんだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"医者か？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"ああ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"医者をやるのは楽しいか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"うーん、機械を作るのは楽しいか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"楽しい。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"そういうことだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"だが、やはり大族長はお前しかいない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"ハァ？　なんでだよ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"ビッグ・アグリーを倒したからだ。ガヴィル、お前の勝利だ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"見ろ、また人が集まってきた、皆お前を見ている。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"チッ、どうすんだ、ドクター？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"自分で決めてくれ。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"答えになってねぇ！"}]},{"label":"……","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"ドクター、狸寝入りはやめろ！　医者のアタシには通用しねぇぞ！"}]},{"label":"大族長ガヴィル万歳！","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"ドクターてめぇ、マジで一発殴ってやろうか？"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"トミミ","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"ガヴィルさん、大丈夫ですか！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"ん？　ああ大丈夫だ。どこに行ってたんだ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"トミミ","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"え？　あっ、その、急にトイレに行きたくなっちゃって！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"そうか……ん？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"トミミ","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"どうしたんですか、急にじっと私を見つめて……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"ハハ、この手があった！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"みんな聞いてくれ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"アタシはビッグ・アグリーに勝った！　だからこれからはアタシが大族長だ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"そこで、お前らに言いたいことがある。それは――"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"拳こそがすべてだ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"トミミ","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"えっ、ガヴィルさん、大族長になってくれるんですか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"しかーし！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"アタシには、まだ大事な用がある！　だから、やっぱりしばらくここを離れなきゃならない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"だが心配すんな！　アタシがいない間、トミミがここをまとめる。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"お前ら全員、このトミミをアタシだと思え！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"トミミ","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"えっ、えええ？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウタゲ","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"えっ、そんなので大丈夫なの？　ここの人たちって、実力至上主義なんじゃないの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"ガヴィルはすべてに打ち勝ち、大族長になった。ヤツの言葉は当然受け入れられるだろう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"ハハッ、ズゥママ、機械も面白ぇけど、やっぱりアタシは拳の方がいい。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"ふんっ、私はまだお前の考えを認めたわけではない。いずれもっと強い機械を作って、お前に再挑戦する。それを忘れるな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"いいぜ、待っててやるよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"おっとその前に、アタシと一緒にロドスに来い。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"なぜだ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"お前の鉱石病を診てもらうんだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"断ってもいいか？　私はまだビッグ・アグリーを……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"こればかりはダメだ。それに今はアタシが大族長だ。お前がなんと言おうが、引っ括ってでも連れて行くからな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ユーネクテス","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"わかった。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"トミミ","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"……ガヴィルさん、やっぱり行っちゃうんですか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"ああ。飛行ユニットにエンジンをつけ直したら、すぐにでも出発するつもりだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"トミミ","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"トミミ","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"ダメです。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ガヴィル","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"は？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"トミミ","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"い、行かせません！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_017_homura","aliases":["ブレイズ"]},{"speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","aliases":["ガヴィル"]},{"speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","aliases":["クロワッサン"]},{"speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","aliases":["ケオベ"]},{"speakerId":"char_337_utage","aliases":["ウタゲ"]},{"speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","aliases":["トミミ"]},{"speakerId":"char_416_zumama","aliases":["ユーネクテス"]}]}
